
=== a directory that is not there is not a failure
no watcher for a path that does not exist: ok

=== a watcher wakes on a rename into the directory
the wait returned as soon as the rename landed: ok

=== the store's own wait returns at once when the object is written
woken by the write rather than by the cap: ok

=== a watcher that has been drained goes quiet again
the wait blocks rather than returning to a stale event: ok

=== a read of an object does not wake a watcher on its directory
neither a read nor a scratch name of ours is reported: ok

=== and returns at the cap when nothing happens
a directory nothing writes to still returns: ok
